<view class="container"><view class="stepper"><text class="step done">✓ 填写</text><text class="step done">✓ 核对</text><text class="step active">3 缴费</text></view><block wx:if="{{!complete}}"><text class="title">报名缴费</text><view class="demo-tag">缴费功能演示 · 不会发起真实付款</view><view class="card order-card"><text class="muted">报名项目</text><text class="section">{{registration.school}}</text><text>{{registration.level}} · {{registration.major}}</text><view class="pay-line"><text>应缴金额</text><text class="price">¥{{registration.fee}}</text></view></view><view class="card"><view class="pay-method"><view class="wechat-pay">✓</view><view><text class="section small">微信支付</text><text class="muted">正式版接入商户号后启用</text></view><text class="selected">●</text></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="finish">模拟支付完成</button><text class="muted center">此按钮仅供甲方查看流程，不产生订单或资金交易。</text></block><view wx:else class="success-card"><view class="success-icon">✓</view><text class="title center">演示流程已完成</text><text class="muted center">正式版将在此显示微信支付结果、报名编号与后续审核进度。</text><button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button><button bindtap="restart">清除演示账号，重新体验</button></view></view>
